# The pipeline box, as ssh reaches it. Copy to scripts/box.conf (gitignored) and fill in.
# HOST-01 (2026-10-12): the OVH box allows no root login; deploys go in as deploy@ with passwordless sudo
# (scripts/box-harden.sh). A box being built before its cutover goes in scripts/box-new.conf, used with --new-box.
SERVER="deploy@box.example.test"
